{"id": "2918965c-9d83-4f73-b6ba-7df9c5a9f871", "slug": "cognitive-architecture-topology", "title": "Cognitive Architecture Topology", "description": "Cognitive Architecture Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Cognitive Architecture Topology\"\ndescription: \"Cognitive Architecture Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#4F46E5\"\n  secondary: \"#0F172A\"\n  accent: \"#A855F7\"\n  background: \"#0F172A\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Cognitive Architecture Topology\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 2; favorites: 2; remixes: 0.\nTags: section, css, layout, content, responsive.\n## Overview\nCognitive Architecture Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nCognitive Architecture Topology Bridging the gap between abstract computational models and resilient, high-performance edge infrastructure. Sequence Alpha — Echo 01 — Heuristic Analysis 02 — Topology Design 03 — Neural…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Cognitive Architecture Topology.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #4F46E5, secondary #0F172A, accent #A855F7, background #0F172A, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"scroll-smooth\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Cognitive Architecture Topology</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-slate-950 text-slate-400 antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col font-sans selection:bg-indigo-500/30 selection:text-indigo-100\"\n      style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.05) 0%, transparent 50%);\">\n\n    <!-- Main App Container -->\n    <div class=\"flex-grow flex items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-8 lg:p-12\">\n\n        <!-- Premium Gradient Border Wrapper -->\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-[1600px] relative rounded-sm p-[1px] overflow-hidden\"\n             style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(79,70,229,0.3) 0%, rgba(15,23,42,1) 40%, rgba(15,23,42,1) 60%, rgba(168,85,247,0.2) 100%); box-shadow: 0 0 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), inset 0 0 20px rgba(79,70,229,0.1);\">\n\n            <!-- Inner Content Layout -->\n            <main class=\"w-full h-full bg-slate-950 relative flex flex-col z-10 rounded-sm\">\n\n                <!-- Header Section -->\n                <header class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 border-b border-slate-800/60 relative z-20 bg-slate-950/50 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                    <!-- Left Title -->\n                    <div class=\"p-8 lg:p-16 lg:pr-24 lg:border-r border-slate-800/60 flex items-center relative overflow-hidden\">\n                        <!-- Subtle ambient glow -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-900/10 to-transparent pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                        <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl xl:text-[88px] font-normal tracking-tight text-slate-100 leading-[1.05] z-10\">\n                            <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"reveal-word block translate-y-[115%]\">Cognitive</span></span><br>\n                            <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"reveal-word block translate-y-[115%]\">Architecture</span></span><br>\n                            <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"reveal-word block translate-y-[115%]\">Topology</span></span>\n                        </h1>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Right Description -->\n                    <div class=\"p-8 lg:p-16 flex flex-col justify-end lg:justify-between items-start lg:items-end relative\">\n                        <div class=\"flex-grow hidden lg:block\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-full flex flex-col items-start lg:items-end text-left lg:text-right z-10\">\n                            <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 lg:mb-12 max-w-sm text-slate-400\">\n                                Bridging the gap between abstract computational models and resilient, high-performance edge infrastructure.\n                            </p>\n                            <div class=\"text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-indigo-400 w-full text-right uppercase pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/60 lg:border-t-0 lg:pt-0\">\n                                Sequence Alpha — Echo\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </header>\n\n                <!-- Content Section -->\n                <section class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 relative z-10 flex-grow min-h-[600px]\">\n\n                    <!-- WebGL / Visual Area -->\n                    <div class=\"relative w-full h-[50vh] lg:h-auto min-h-[400px] lg:border-r border-slate-800/60 bg-slate-950 overflow-hidden group\">\n\n                        <!-- WebGL Canvas Container -->\n                        <div id=\"webgl-canvas-mount\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Overlay Gradients for integration -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-10\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at center, transparent 30%, rgba(2,6,23,0.8) 100%);\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-32 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950 to-transparent pointer-events-none z-10 lg:hidden\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Process List & CTA Area -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col h-full bg-slate-950/80 relative\">\n\n                        <!-- List Wrapper -->\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col w-full border-b border-slate-800/60 list-container\">\n                            <!-- Item 01 -->\n                            <div class=\"list-item flex items-center px-8 lg:px-12 py-5 lg:py-7 border-b border-slate-800/60 hover:bg-slate-900/50 transition-colors duration-300 group cursor-default\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 w-16 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors\">01</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 mx-4\">—</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-slate-300 group-hover:text-slate-100 transition-colors\">Heuristic Analysis</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <!-- Item 02 -->\n                            <div class=\"list-item flex items-center px-8 lg:px-12 py-5 lg:py-7 border-b border-slate-800/60 hover:bg-slate-900/50 transition-colors duration-300 group cursor-default\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 w-16 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors\">02</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 mx-4\">—</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-slate-300 group-hover:text-slate-100 transition-colors\">Topology Design</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <!-- Item 03 -->\n                            <div class=\"list-item flex items-center px-8 lg:px-12 py-5 lg:py-7 border-b border-slate-800/60 hover:bg-slate-900/50 transition-colors duration-300 group cursor-default\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 w-16 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors\">03</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 mx-4\">—</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-slate-300 group-hover:text-slate-100 transition-colors\">Neural Synthesis</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <!-- Item 04 -->\n                            <div class=\"list-item flex items-center px-8 lg:px-12 py-5 lg:py-7 border-b border-slate-800/60 hover:bg-slate-900/50 transition-colors duration-300 group cursor-default\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 w-16 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors\">04</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 mx-4\">—</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-slate-300 group-hover:text-slate-100 transition-colors\">Stateful Execution</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <!-- Item 05 -->\n                            <div class=\"list-item flex items-center px-8 lg:px-12 py-5 lg:py-7 hover:bg-slate-900/50 transition-colors duration-300 group cursor-default\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 w-16 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors\">05</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm text-slate-700 mx-4\">—</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-slate-300 group-hover:text-slate-100 transition-colors\">Edge Distribution</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- CTA Block -->\n                        <div class=\"p-8 lg:p-16 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-end relative overflow-hidden\">\n                            <!-- Background glow for CTA -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-72 h-72 bg-indigo-900/10 blur-[100px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                            <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-[420px] text-slate-400 z-10\">\n                                Deploying robust neural networks requires precision. Initialize the sequence to align your operational vectors with our deployment grid.\n                            </p>\n\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end z-10 w-full flex-wrap gap-6\">\n                                <a href=\"#\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-200 hover:text-white transition-colors relative pb-1\">\n                                    Commence Sequence\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" width=\"1.2em\" height=\"1.2em\" class=\"text-indigo-400 group-hover:text-indigo-300 transition-colors group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    <!-- Animated Gradient Underline -->\n                                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-[1px] bg-slate-700 group-hover:h-[2px] transition-all duration-300\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(79,70,229,0) 0%, rgba(79,70,229,1) 50%, rgba(79,70,229,0) 100%); background-size: 200% 100%; animation: shimmer 2s infinite linear; opacity: 0;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.opacity='1'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.opacity='0'\"></div>\n                                    <style>\n                                        @keyframes shimmer { 0% { background-position: 100% 0; } 100% { background-position: -100% 0; } }\n                                    </style>\n                                </a>\n\n                                <!-- Status Badge -->\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 border border-indigo-900/50 bg-indigo-950/30 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-sm\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(99,102,241,0.8); animation: pulse-glow 2s infinite;\"></div>\n                                    <style>\n                                        @keyframes pulse-glow { 0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); } 50% { opacity: 0.5; transform: scale(0.8); } }\n                                    </style>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-indigo-300 uppercase tracking-wide\">Grid Online</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </main>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Application Logic Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n\n            // --- GSAP Animations ---\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // 1. Masked Word Reveal for Title\n            gsap.to(\".reveal-word\", {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n\n            // 2. Staggered List Items on Scroll\n            gsap.to(\".list-item\", {\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \".list-container\",\n                    start: \"top 85%\",\n                },\n                opacity: 1,\n                x: 0,\n                duration: 0.8,\n                stagger: 0.1,\n                ease: \"power2.out\"\n            });\n\n\n            // --- WebGL Setup (Faceted Geometric Shape) ---\n            const container = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas-mount');\n            if (!container || !window.THREE) return;\n\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n            // Camera\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.z = 6;\n            camera.position.y = 0;\n\n            // Renderer\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ antialias: true, alpha: true, powerPreference: \"high-performance\" });\n            renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n            renderer.toneMapping = THREE.ACESFilmicToneMapping;\n            renderer.toneMappingExposure = 1.2;\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            // Group for rotation\n            const objectGroup = new THREE.Group();\n            scene.add(objectGroup);\n\n            // Geometry: Dodecahedron creates a distinct faceted crystalline shape\n            const geometry = new THREE.DodecahedronGeometry(1.6, 0); // 0 detail = flat facets\n\n            // Material: Physically based, metallic, highly reflective, flat shaded\n            const material = new THREE.MeshPhysicalMaterial({\n                color: 0x0f172a,         // Deep slate base\n                metalness: 0.9,          // Highly metallic\n                roughness: 0.15,         // Slightly glossy\n                emissive: 0x1e1b4b,      // Deep purple internal glow\n                emissiveIntensity: 0.4,\n                clearcoat: 1.0,\n                clearcoatRoughness: 0.1,\n                flatShading: true        // CRITICAL: Creates the hard edges/facets\n            });\n\n            const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n            objectGroup.add(mesh);\n\n            // Wireframe Accent (slightly larger to sit on edges)\n            const edgeGeo = new THREE.EdgesGeometry(geometry);\n            const edgeMat = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({\n                color: 0x6366f1, // Indigo highlight\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.3,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n            const wireframe = new THREE.LineSegments(edgeGeo, edgeMat);\n            objectGroup.add(wireframe);\n\n            // Dynamic Lighting\n            // Ambient to lift pure blacks\n            const ambientLight = new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff, 0.2);\n            scene.add(ambientLight);\n\n            // Main directional light (cool white/blue)\n            const mainLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xe0e7ff, 3.0);\n            mainLight.position.set(5, 8, 5);\n            scene.add(mainLight);\n\n            // Secondary colored fill light (purple/magenta)\n            const fillLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xa855f7, 2.0);\n            fillLight.position.set(-5, -2, 2);\n            scene.add(fillLight);\n\n            // Rim light (cyan/indigo) for dramatic edge highlights\n            const rimLight = new THREE.PointLight(0x818cf8, 4, 15);\n            rimLight.position.set(0, 3, -5);\n            scene.add(rimLight);\n\n            // Mouse Interaction\n            let mouseX = 0;\n            let mouseY = 0;\n            let targetX = 0;\n            let targetY = 0;\n            const windowHalfX = window.innerWidth / 2;\n            const windowHalfY = window.innerHeight / 2;\n\n            container.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n                const rect = container.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const x = event.clientX - rect.left;\n                const y = event.clientY - rect.top;\n                mouseX = (x - container.clientWidth / 2) * 0.002;\n                mouseY = (y - container.clientHeight / 2) * 0.002;\n            });\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            function animate() {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const time = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                // Ease toward mouse position\n                targetX += (mouseX - targetX) * 0.05;\n                targetY += (mouseY - targetY) * 0.05;\n\n                // Base rotation + mouse interaction\n                objectGroup.rotation.y = time * 0.2 + targetX;\n                objectGroup.rotation.x = time * 0.1 + targetY;\n\n                // Floating motion\n                objectGroup.position.y = Math.sin(time * 0.8) * 0.2;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            }\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Resize Handler\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                if(container && camera && renderer) {\n                    camera.aspect = container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight;\n                    camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                    renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n                }\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "cognitive-architecture-topology.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/cognitive-architecture-topology.jpg", "source_name": "cognitive-architecture-topology-DESIGN.md", "views": 44, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T02:34:47.227911+00:00"}